    <item>
      <title>Forest Value</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/research-themes/forest-value/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/research-themes/forest-value/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;page-hero&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/research/forest-value.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Forest Value&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;page-hero-overlay&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h1&gt;Forest Value&lt;/h1&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Evaluating the environmental, ecological, and social value of forests.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Overview&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;overview&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#overview&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Forests provide many forms of value beyond timber production.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;They support biodiversity, store carbon, regulate water, protect landscapes, and contribute to human well-being. Our laboratory evaluates these values from ecological, environmental, economic, and social perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Research Questions&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;research-questions&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#research-questions&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;How can the multiple values of forests be measured and visualized?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;How do forest conditions influence ecosystem services?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;How can forest value be reflected in management and policy decisions?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;How do people perceive and use forest?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Research Topics&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;research-topics&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#research-topics&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Ecosystem services&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Biodiversity assessment&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Carbon sequestration&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Landscape evaluation&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Sustainable forest management&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Social and cultural value of forests&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Methods&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;methods&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#methods&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We combine field surveys, spatial analysis, environmental assessment, and social surveys to evaluate forest value from multiple perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Wood Utilization</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/research-themes/wood-utilization/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/research-themes/wood-utilization/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;page-hero&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/research/wood-utilization.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Wood Utilization&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;page-hero-overlay&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h1&gt;Wood Utilization&lt;/h1&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Assessing the environmental performance and climate benefits of wood utilization.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Overview&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;overview&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#overview&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Wood utilization can contribute to climate change mitigation, regional industries, and sustainable forest management.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Our laboratory evaluates the environmental impacts and benefits of wood products throughout their life cycles, from forest management and harvesting to manufacturing, use, recycling, and disposal.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Research Questions&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;research-questions&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#research-questions&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;What are the greenhouse gas emissions associated with wood products?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;How much carbon is stored in long-lived wood products?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Under what conditions does wood substitution reduce environmental impacts?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;How can local wood utilization support sustainable forest management?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Research Topics&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;research-topics&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#research-topics&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Life Cycle Assessment&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Greenhouse gas accounting&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Carbon storage in wood products&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Material and energy substitution&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Local timber utilization&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Circular use of wood resources&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Methods&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;methods&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#methods&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We use Life Cycle Assessment, carbon accounting, material flow analysis, and scenario analysis to evaluate the environmental performance of wood utilization.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Regional Economy</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/research-themes/regional-economy/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/research-themes/regional-economy/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;page-hero&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/research/regional-economy.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Regional Economy&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;page-hero-overlay&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h1&gt;Regional Economy&lt;/h1&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Evaluating the regional economic impacts of forestry and wood-based industries.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Overview&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;overview&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#overview&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Forestry and wood utilization generate economic activity through harvesting, transportation, processing, construction, and related local industries.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Our laboratory studies how forest resources and wood-based industries contribute to regional employment, income, production, and economic circulation.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Research Questions&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;research-questions&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#research-questions&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;How much economic activity is generated by forestry and wood utilization?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Which industries benefit from increased local timber use?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;How does local procurement affect the regional economy?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;How can forest-related industries contribute to regional revitalization?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Research Topics&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;research-topics&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#research-topics&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Regional economic ripple effects&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Forestry and timber industries&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Local procurement&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Employment and income generation&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Supply chains&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Regional revitalization&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Methods&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;methods&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#methods&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We use input-output analysis, economic ripple-effect analysis, supply-chain analysis, statistical data, and interviews with local stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Satoyama &amp; Communities</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/research-themes/satoyama-community/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/research-themes/satoyama-community/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;page-hero&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/research/satoyama-community.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Satoyama &amp;amp; Communities&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;page-hero-overlay&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h1&gt;Satoyama &amp;amp; Communities&lt;/h1&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Exploring relationships between forests, biodiversity, culture, and local communities.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Overview&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;overview&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#overview&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Satoyama landscapes have been shaped through long-term interactions between people and nature.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Changes in population, lifestyles, and forest use have weakened many of these relationships. Our laboratory studies ways to reconnect people with forests through biodiversity, local knowledge, forest products, cultural practices, and community activities.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
